{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/homesick4.gif?t=1747357913\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A psychological computer game by jnity, assisted by celesware</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/homesick1.gif?t=1747357913\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WILL THE FAMILIAR FACES RETURN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HOMESICKNESS</strong> is a solely developed point-and-click free-roam psychological horror game that delves into the depths and nuances of nostalgia and primitive online media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Theo as he explores the empty, desolate halls of <strong>CHILDREEF</strong>, making his way to the lower floors. With the Kids' Multi-tool, uncover hidden exits and find your way down as you attempt to make sense of what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, collect items, find special tools for survival, and overcome what awaits in the seemingly empty corridors of <strong>CHILDREEF</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each game over, things begin to change. Previously visited paths become blocked, and disorientation starts to set in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep an eye on unseen corners; you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/homesick2.gif?t=1747357913\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEST THE UNSEEN CORNERS HARBOR HIDDEN TRUTHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as young Theo, awakening in a place long forgotten. In his possession is a lone tape, left behind by a loved one who holds a place in his heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The remnants of the tape serve as your only guide, leading you deeper into the daycare of CHILDREEF. As you listen to the tape's fragmented messages, clues begin to emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The voice that speaks on the other end is the one that will guide you. She waits for you to come, on your way down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/homesick3.gif?t=1747357913\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Point-and-click free-roam exploration</strong> spanning three segments, where every corner must be checked; every item has a purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Varied mechanics for each threat</strong>, each centered around a different tool at your disposal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A deep dive into the nuances and symptoms of nostalgia</strong>, portrayed through an abstract, surreal lens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A flexible, carefully crafted 2000s aesthetic</strong> that reinforces the core themes and atmosphere of <strong>HOMESICKNESS</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lite gameplay randomization</strong>; with every death, room functions shift, previous exits disappear, and items appear in different locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An emotional, psychological story</strong>, woven into <strong>every</strong> aspect of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expansive post-game content</strong>, directly expanding on the main narrative; once you finish the game, there will still be much to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Accessibility options and a highly customizable UI</strong>; playable with both mouse and keyboard or mouse only. The game does not rely on sound, though audio enhances the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Optimized performance</strong>, ensuring smooth gameplay on most mid-range modern computers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A minimum of 1GB of RAM is required to run the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597480?t=1747357913","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/0a5c57514f8872d4fe60c4a8676bdd233151dbd5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747357913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/08aba4aa4c0f42383699fcc47e8bbf56936199d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747357913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/08aba4aa4c0f42383699fcc47e8bbf56936199d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747357913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/homesick4.gif?t=1747357913\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A psychological computer game by jnity, assisted by celesware</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/homesick1.gif?t=1747357913\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WILL THE FAMILIAR FACES RETURN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HOMESICKNESS</strong> is a solely developed point-and-click free-roam psychological horror game that delves into the depths and nuances of nostalgia and primitive online media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Theo as he explores the empty, desolate halls of <strong>CHILDREEF</strong>, making his way to the lower floors. With the Kids' Multi-tool, uncover hidden exits and find your way down as you attempt to make sense of what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, collect items, find special tools for survival, and overcome what awaits in the seemingly empty corridors of <strong>CHILDREEF</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each game over, things begin to change. Previously visited paths become blocked, and disorientation starts to set in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep an eye on unseen corners; you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/homesick2.gif?t=1747357913\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEST THE UNSEEN CORNERS HARBOR HIDDEN TRUTHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as young Theo, awakening in a place long forgotten. In his possession is a lone tape, left behind by a loved one who holds a place in his heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The remnants of the tape serve as your only guide, leading you deeper into the daycare of CHILDREEF. As you listen to the tape's fragmented messages, clues begin to emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The voice that speaks on the other end is the one that will guide you. She waits for you to come, on your way down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/extras/homesick3.gif?t=1747357913\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Point-and-click free-roam exploration</strong> spanning three segments, where every corner must be checked; every item has a purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Varied mechanics for each threat</strong>, each centered around a different tool at your disposal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A deep dive into the nuances and symptoms of nostalgia</strong>, portrayed through an abstract, surreal lens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A flexible, carefully crafted 2000s aesthetic</strong> that reinforces the core themes and atmosphere of <strong>HOMESICKNESS</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lite gameplay randomization</strong>; with every death, room functions shift, previous exits disappear, and items appear in different locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An emotional, psychological story</strong>, woven into <strong>every</strong> aspect of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expansive post-game content</strong>, directly expanding on the main narrative; once you finish the game, there will still be much to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Accessibility options and a highly customizable UI</strong>; playable with both mouse and keyboard or mouse only. The game does not rely on sound, though audio enhances the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Optimized performance</strong>, ensuring smooth gameplay on most mid-range modern computers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A minimum of 1GB of RAM is required to run the game.</p>","developers":["jnity","celesware"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597480/285a5e4f0034b8eed38eb38f5236d85bb06fb935/header.jpg?t=1747357913","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114583,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114583/movie480.mp4?t=1743555882","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114583/movie_max.mp4?t=1743555882"},"name":"HOMESICKNESS \u2014 Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai